                                "sense_id": "66b50eaa-c89e-39ee-acd2-5cc33808f5de",
                                "text": "The foreign ladies, in their simple, tasteful, fresh attire, innocent of the humpings and bunchings, the monstrosities and deformities of ultra-fashionable bad taste, beamed with cheerfulness, friendliness, and kindliness."
